    ],
    "text": "Land Ministry Ref. No.: 4-3/7/2016/HW/538.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.2,
      552.8,
      295.2,
      598.88
    ],
    "text": "I hereby give notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 asamendment by the land acquisition Act. No. 28 of 1964, thatthe Government intends to acquire the following lands whichare required for a public purpose.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      66.24,
      612.79,
      229.6,
      622.88
    ],
    "text": "Description of the lands to be acquired:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.2,
      632.0,
      295.27,
      726.08
    ],
    "text": "The allotment of land, containing in extent of 0.0299 Hectare,Lot. 14902 (1 lot) under mentioned land shown in the SurveyorGeneral's plan of F.V.P. 1187 Supplement No. 04 and SheetNo.06 dated 22.02.2019, situated in the village ofParanagampitiya in Grama Niladhari Division of No. 522,Bakmeegolla in the Minor Division of Ihala Wisideke WestKorale in the Divisional Secretary's Division of Ibbagamuwain the Kurunegala District in North Western Province.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      307.2,
      453.2,
      547.61,
      535.28
    ],
    "text": "01. Lot No. 14902Name of Land: Wathumullekumbura; Description: PaddyField; Claimant: Government ; Original Claimant: A Part of LotNo. 13454. Taken over under section 38 (A) of LandAcquisition Act. Original Claimant Seiyadu AhamaduNabishan. To finalize the land acquisition process; Extent:0.0299 Hectare. (299 sqm)",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      307.2,
      545.6,
      547.42,
      663.68
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land/lands on whicha servitude is to be acquired by are hereby required to appearpersonally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before meat Ibbagamuwa Divisional Secretariat, on the day of the 10thJune 2019 at 09.30 a.m. and are hereby requested to notify tome in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 27th May 2019the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of theirclaims for computation for the said land/servitude the amountof compensation and the details of the computation of suchamount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      453.6,
      671.6,
      540.6,
      681.68
    ],
